          <div class="ml-keys" id="tf-keys">
            <button type="button" class="ml-key" data-ins="z">z</button>
            <button type="button" class="ml-key" data-ins="i">i</button>
            <button type="button" class="ml-key" data-ins="conj(z)"><span style="text-decoration:overline">z</span></button>
            <button type="button" class="ml-key" data-ins="x">x</button>
            <button type="button" class="ml-key" data-ins="y">y</button>
            <button type="button" class="ml-key" data-ins=" = ">=</button>
            <button type="button" class="ml-key" data-ins="(|)">(&nbsp;)</button>
            <button type="button" class="ml-key" data-ins="(|)/(|)">a⁄b</button>
            <button type="button" class="ml-key" data-ins="sqrt(|)">√</button>
            <button type="button" class="ml-key" data-ins="pi">π</button>
            <button type="button" class="ml-key" data-ins="exp(i*|)">e<sup>iθ</sup></button>
            <button type="button" class="ml-key" data-ins="+">+</button>
            <button type="button" class="ml-key" data-ins="-">−</button>
            <button type="button" class="ml-key" data-ins="*">×</button>
            <button type="button" class="ml-key is-util" data-act="back">⌫</button>
            <button type="button" class="ml-key is-util" data-act="clear">C</button>
          </div>
          <div class="ml-ops" id="tf-ops">
            <button class="ml-op ml-op--hero" type="button"><i class="bi bi-check2-circle"></i> Calculer</button>
          </div>
          <div class="ml-hint">Directes : translation, homothétie, rotation, similitude (z′ = az + b). Indirectes : réflexion, symétrie glissée, similitude indirecte (z′ = a<span style="text-decoration:overline">z</span> + b, le conjugué s’écrit <strong>conj(z)</strong> ou touche <span style="text-decoration:overline">z</span>). Nombres complexes : <strong>1+i</strong>, <strong>sqrt(3)/2</strong>, <strong>exp(i*pi/3)</strong> ; angles : <strong>pi/3</strong> ou <strong>60°</strong>. Droite : <strong>y = 2x + 1</strong>, <strong>x = 3</strong> ou deux points <strong>1 ; 2+i</strong>.</div>
