          <div class="ml-preview is-empty" id="oq-preview">Aperçu de l’énoncé… (les maths sont reconnues automatiquement)</div>

          <div class="oq-kbd">
            <div class="oq-kbd__lbl"><i class="bi bi-keyboard"></i> Clavier maths — s’insère dans le champ où se trouve le curseur</div>
            <div class="ml-keys" id="oq-keys" style="margin:0">
              <button type="button" class="ml-key" data-ins="^2">x²</button>
              <button type="button" class="ml-key" data-ins="^3">x³</button>
              <button type="button" class="ml-key" data-ins="^(|)">xⁿ</button>
              <button type="button" class="ml-key" data-ins="(|)/()">a⁄b</button>
              <button type="button" class="ml-key" data-ins="sqrt(|)">√</button>
              <button type="button" class="ml-key" data-ins="root(|, )">ⁿ√</button>
              <button type="button" class="ml-key is-fn" data-ins="ln(|)">ln</button>
              <button type="button" class="ml-key" data-ins="e^(|)">eˣ</button>
              <button type="button" class="ml-key is-fn" data-ins="abs(|)">|x|</button>
              <button type="button" class="ml-key" data-ins="(|)">( )</button>
              <button type="button" class="ml-key" data-ins="pi">π</button>
              <button type="button" class="ml-key" data-ins="∞">∞</button>
              <button type="button" class="ml-key" data-ins=" ≤ ">≤</button>
              <button type="button" class="ml-key" data-ins=" ≥ ">≥</button>
              <button type="button" class="ml-key" data-ins=" ≠ ">≠</button>
              <button type="button" class="ml-key" data-ins=" ∈ ">∈</button>
              <button type="button" class="ml-key" data-ins="ℝ">ℝ</button>
              <button type="button" class="ml-key is-fn" data-ins="int(|, , )">∫ₐᵇ</button>
              <button type="button" class="ml-key is-fn" data-ins="lim(x→|, )">lim</button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="oq-part"><span class="oq-part__n">2</span> À démontrer / À faire <span class="oq-part__hint">— choisissez le type de chaque question</span></div>
          <div id="oq-questions"></div>
          <button type="button" class="geo-add" id="oq-add"><i class="bi bi-plus-lg"></i> Ajouter une question</button>

          <div class="ml-side" id="oq-mode">
            <button type="button" class="ml-sidebtn is-active" data-oqmode="hint"><i class="bi bi-lightbulb"></i> Coup de pouce</button>
            <button type="button" class="ml-sidebtn" data-oqmode="full"><i class="bi bi-journal-check"></i> Solution rédigée</button>
          </div>
          <div class="ml-ops" id="oq-ops" style="align-items:center">
            <button class="ml-op ml-op--hero" id="oq-go" type="button"><i class="bi bi-stars"></i> Obtenir de l’aide</button>
            <span class="oq-quota" id="oq-quota" data-used="<%= typeof oqUsed !== 'undefined' ? oqUsed : 0 %>" data-limit="<%= (typeof oqLimit !== 'undefined' && oqLimit !== null) ? oqLimit : '' %>"></span>
